The Gus–Ben–Hana triple must sit in three consecutive slots, and Dev must sit immediately after Ivo. Elif has to fall at least three slots before Ben and at least two after Ivo, and Cara is exactly two slots from Ben. The only placement that satisfies every constraint is below. The team note is wrong: Cara is in 5, not 4, and Elif is before Cara.

SCHEDULE: {"1":"Ann","2":"Ivo","3":"Dev","4":"Elif","5":"Cara","6":"Gus","7":"Ben","8":"Hana","9":"Finn"}
